# AmrNavigateToPose
# amr_manager -> amr_navigation 单点导航 Action（按坐标导航，纯能力接口）
# 状态常量见 amr_interfaces/msg/NavigationState.msg

# ===== Goal =====

uint64 navigation_id                # 客户端生成的导航请求 id；与当前导航不一致时，服务端先取消旧目标
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped goal_pose

---

# ===== Result =====

uint64 navigation_id
bool success
string message

---

# ===== Feedback =====

uint64 navigation_id
amr_interfaces/msg/NavigationState state
float32 distance_remaining
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped current_pose
